      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Progressive discipline generally follows a staged approach, starting with informal coaching or a verbal warning for minor issues. If the behavior continues, the process usually escalates to a formal written warning, clearly outlining expected improvements. Subsequent infractions typically lead to further disciplinary actions such as suspension, before ultimately progressing to termination if performance or conduct does not improve. Consistent and thorough documentation at every step is crucial for maintaining fairness and legal defensibility.",
