      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. what kind of specific stuff should i be documenting in those initial steps? like if someone is just being difficult or not following the culture/norms, how do i make sure my notes are formal enough so it doesn't look like i'm just being personal or picking on them? i want to make sure i'm acting as a neutral leader.",
